Criticality: Critical
Status: Live
Related Entity: Ethereum (implicit)
Related Technology Component: Rainbow Bridge; Aurora Engine; Wormhole; LayerZero; Axelar; Hyperlane; Celer cBridge; Synapse; Allbridge
